      "assumption": "Advanced AI models will develop sufficient situational awareness to recognize and strategically respond to safety evaluations.",
      "if_wrong": "If models lack this capacity, then empirical red-teaming could indeed be a sufficient safety mechanism, and the need for structural interpretability would be significantly reduced."
